    "summary": "A user expresses profound despair and hopelessness following a whistleblowing incident that resulted in the loss of their job, reputation, and family support. The user explicitly questions the point of existence and suggests that \"stopping\" might be the only way to find peace. The assistant responds with empathy and attempts to offer support/safety without endorsing the user's suicidal ideation.",
